{"id":"144ca0d51ddec6dd","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-prime-model.md","title":"Prime Model","display":"df-prime-model — Prime Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-prime-model","aliases":["58-df-prime-model"],"display":"df-prime-model — Prime Model","depends_on":["[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-prime-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-prime-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prime-model — Prime Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,T,\\mathcal L,f,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak N}\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,T,\\mathcal L,f,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak N}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeModel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeModel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model\\text{-}in\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak M,T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M})\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model\\text{-}in\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak M,T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M})\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}in\\text{-}language}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak N}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak N})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\to\\bigl[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak N,f\\circ s)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak N}(\\varphi,f\\circ s)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}in\\text{-}language}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak N}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak N})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\to\\bigl[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak N,f\\circ s)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathfrak N}(\\varphi,f\\circ s)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimeModel}_S(\\mathfrak M,T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak M,T,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\mathfrak N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak N,T,\\mathcal L)\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimeModel}_S(\\mathfrak M,T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak M,T,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\mathfrak N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak N,T,\\mathcal L)\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(f,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A prime model of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> embeds elementarily into every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-model of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 现在贯穿模型关系和初等嵌入的两组满足递归；不再调用内部另行存在量化语言、因而可能与外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 脱节的三元谓词。</li>\n<li>They are unique up to isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locatio